:Class GridDataTypes
⍝ All data types the "Grid" class does support

    ∇ r←Char
      :Access Public Shared
      r←1
    ∇

    ∇ r←Numeric
      :Access Public Shared
      r←2
    ∇

    ∇ r←Currency
      :Access Public Shared
      r←3
    ∇

    ∇ r←Date
      :Access Public Shared
      r←4
    ∇

    ∇ r←DateTime
      :Access Public Shared
      r←5
    ∇

    ∇ r←DropEdit
      :Access Public Shared
      r←6
    ∇

    ∇ r←DropDown
      :Access Public Shared
      r←7
    ∇

    ∇ r←Time
      :Access Public Shared
      r←8
    ∇

    ∇ r←YesNo
      :Access Public Shared
      r←9
    ∇

⍝⍝⍝ Functions

    ∇ r←∆List
      :Access Public Shared
      r←⍉{⍵,[-0.5]⍎¨⍵}(⎕NL-3)~'∆'⎕NL-3
    ∇

    ∇ r←∆GetName int;list
      :Access Public Shared
      list←∆List
      list[list[;1]⍳int;0]
    ∇

:EndClass
